WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Watch The Bulletins. Follow PAGASA weather bulletins and your barangay announcements.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.950
Secure Your Home. Close and secure windows and doors. Move loose items indoors.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.950
Check Your Go-Bag. Water, food, medicines, flashlight, radio, documents and a charged power bank.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.950
Know Where To Go. Know the way to your evacuation centre and leave early when officials say so.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.950
Stay Connected. Charge phones, write down emergency numbers and tell family your plan.

